  "description": "If you've got bicycling on your mind but crave the added stability and comfort of a three wheeler, then the Sun Traditional trike is just what you're looking for. This new Traditional 24” 7-Speed model takes all of the great features of the original Traditional 24” trike and adds easy twist-shift gearing to smooth out the hills. We’ve also added a powerful rear disc brake to complement the front linear-pull brake for solid on-demand stopping power. With its comfortable ride quality, low step-over frame and great equipment, the Traditional trike line has been a best-seller for years and now it’s even more well equipped. Take the Traditional 24” 7-Speed for a spin today and see for yourself how bright the Sun is.\nHigh-tensile steel Low-Step frame\nSunrace 7-speed drivetrain (13-15-18-21-24-28-34T)\nSunrace twist shifter\nAlloy linear-pull front brake with parking lock\nMechanical disc rear brake with parking lock\nAlloy rims with stainless steel spokes\n24\" x 1.75\" tires\n9\" high-rise steel handlebar and stem, foam grips\nSun Tractor saddle with heavy duty steel base\nSteel chain guard and nickel plated front fender\nVinyl coated steel wire basket",
